  "worked_solution": "We identify the leading term and compute its limit. In this case, we raise the main term of the base polynomial to the given power.\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{lim}_{t\\to -\\infty }{(4{t}^{3}-t)}^{4} & ={lim}_{t\\to -\\infty }{(4{t}^{3})}^{4} \\\\  & ={lim}_{t\\to -\\infty }256{t}^{12} \\\\  & =256\\cdot {lim}_{t\\to -\\infty }{t}^{12} \\\\  & =256\\cdot \\infty  \\\\  & =\\infty \\end{aligned}\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
